<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/data-types/data-type/feature-collection> a dt:DataType, rim:Concept, skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme dt:dataTypes ; skos:prefLabel "Feature collection"@en ; skos:definition "A set of features, each with a geometry and attributes -- e.g. a SAGA shapes layer or an OGC API - Features feature collection."@en ; dct:source [ dct:title "OGC 17-069r4 OGC API - Features - Part 1: Core"@en ; dct:references <https://docs.ogc.org/is/17-069r4/17-069r4.html> ] .
